/T (The Vehicle Rental Management System is a database-driven web application designed to organize vehicle rental operations. It maintains vehicle and customer records, rentals, payments, maintenance history, and reports in a centralized MySQL database. The web interface is built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript; the backend uses Python Flask, and database access uses mysql-connector-python.)
/E (The Vehicle Rental Management System is a database-driven web application designed to organize vehicle rental operations. It maintains vehicle and customer records, rentals, payments, maintenance history, and reports in a centralized MySQL database. The web interface is built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript; the backend uses Python Flask, and database access uses mysql-connector-python.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
