<<
/Title (The Vehicle Rental Management System demonstrates how a relational database can support vehicle rental operations. It combines web-based record management with MySQL tables, views, stored procedures, triggers, and report queries. Testing confirmed that the main application modules opened and that test records could be saved and viewed. The project demonstrates database design, application-to-database connectivity, and CRUD operations.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 590 0 R
/Next 773 0 R
>>
